g=A.tu("https://apps.apple.com/in/app/arham-order-management-system/id6476415122","Arham OMS is a comprehensive Order Management System designed for pharmaceutical sales representatives, distributors, and stockists. The application streamlines order booking, sales operations, field-force tracking, expense management, and customer engagement while supporting both online and offline workflows.\n\nBuilt with Flutter, the app enables sales representatives to continue working seamlessly even without internet connectivity through a robust SQLite-based offline architecture. The system provides real-time location tracking, route monitoring, hierarchy-based user management, beat planning, target management, and automated reporting to improve operational efficiency and sales performance.",A.b(["OFFLINE-FIRST ARCHITECTURE","Implemented SQLite-based offline data storage and synchronization","Allows order booking, customer selection, and data access without internet connectivity","","ORDER MANAGEMENT","Create and manage orders for parties and stockists","Start Order / End Order workflow with online and offline support","Order history and detailed order reports","","FIELD FORCE TRACKING","Continuous background location tracking for sales representatives","Trip tracking with route visualization on Google Maps","Automatic route recording and journey history","","CUSTOMER & STOCKIST MANAGEMENT","Stockist selection and party management","Hierarchy-wise user and customer management","Customer visit tracking and engagement","","BEAT MANAGEMENT","Beat Master for defining sales territories","Beat Planner for scheduling future visits","Calendar-based beat planning and execution","","TARGET MANAGEMENT","Monthly sales target configuration","Secondary target tracking and monitoring","Performance analytics and progress tracking","","TASK MANAGEMENT","Create, assign, and track tasks across departments","Department-wise task visibility and status management","","REIMBURSEMENT MODULE","Expense claim submission with supporting documents","Daily allowance and other allowance management","","SELFIE CHECK-IN SYSTEM","Mandatory selfie capture during first Start Order of the day","Attendance verification and field activity validation","","WHATSAPP INTEGRATION","Automatically share order reports with parties and stockists","Instant order confirmation after successful order placement","","REFERRAL SYSTEM","Referral code generation and tracking","User referral management workflow","","UI/UX MODERNIZATION","Redesigned and upgraded major application screens","Improved usability, responsiveness, and user experience","","PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATION","Optimized API integrations and data loading","Reduced response times and improved overall application speed"],h),"assets/images/arham_oms_logo.png","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.arhamerp.app&pcampaignid=web_share",j,["assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/1_homepage.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/2_menu_grid.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/3_menu_list.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/4_dashboard.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/5_product_page.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/6_party_bottomsheet.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/7_product_page.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/8_cart.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/9_order_confirm.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/10_whatsapp.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/11_whatsapp.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/12_route_summary.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/13_route_summary_users.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/14_profile.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/15_drawer.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/16_party_master.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/17_1_add_party.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/17_2_add_party.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/18_beat_master.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/19_add_beat.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/20_beat_scheduler.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/21_select_beat.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/22_beat_info.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/23_create_task.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/24_assign_task.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/25_assigned_task.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/26_referral.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/27_referral_earning.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/28_my_reimbursements.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/29_reimbursement_approvals.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/30_reimbursement_request.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/31_reimbursement_approve_sheet.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/arham_oms/32_monthly_target.jpg"],g,"Arham OMS - Order Management System")
