q=A.tu(j,"ApproveRx is a pharmaceutical ordering and inventory management application that enables users to browse products, place orders, and manage day-to-day sales operations efficiently. My primary contribution involved upgrading the user interface, redesigning multiple screens, integrating updated APIs, and enhancing overall application usability and performance.\n\nThe application now offers a more modern user experience, faster data loading through paginated APIs, and barcode scanning capabilities for quicker product search and order processing.",A.b(["UI/UX ENHANCEMENT","Redesigned and modernized multiple application screens","Improved user experience and visual consistency","Created and implemented new screen designs","","API INTEGRATION","Integrated updated backend APIs","Refactored data flows for improved maintainability","","PAGINATION IMPLEMENTATION","Implemented server-side pagination for product listings","Improved performance and reduced loading times","","BARCODE SCANNING","Added mobile barcode scanning functionality","Quick product search and identification through barcode scanning","","PERFORMANCE IMPROVEMENTS","Optimized API calls and screen rendering","Enhanced responsiveness across the application"],h),"assets/images/approveRx_logo_new.png","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.arhamcorp.approverx&pcampaignid=web_share",j,[],q,"ApproveRx")
