n=A.tu(j,"Unani Quiz Bank is a cross-platform educational app built with Flutter, designed to help students and practitioners strengthen their knowledge of Unani medicine through structured quizzes. The app offers multiple quiz formats covering core Unani concepts as well as selected topics from modern medicine, making learning both comprehensive and engaging.\n\nUser progress and quiz data are securely managed using Firebase and Cloud Firestore, ensuring reliable performance and real-time data synchronization. With a simple, intuitive interface and seamless support for both Android and iOS devices, Unani Quiz Bank provides an efficient and accessible platform for self-assessment and continuous learning.",A.b([i,"Secure login and sign-up using Firebase Authentication","Personalized profiles with quiz history tracking","","QUIZ SYSTEM","Subject-wise and category-wise quiz selection","Multiple quiz modes: practice and test","","QUESTION MANAGEMENT","Real-time question bank stored in Firebase Firestore","Dynamic loading of questions for smoother performance","","PERFORMANCE TRACKING","Instant scoring and result display after each quiz","Progress history to track improvement over time","","USER EXPERIENCE","Clean, responsive interface for better engagement","Lightweight design optimized for mobile use"],h),"assets/images/unani_icon.png","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.unanimedstudy.unaniquizbank",j,["assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/login_screen.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/register_screen.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/home_screen.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/select_mode.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/quiz_screen.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/leaderboard_screen.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/profile_screen.jpg"],n,"Unani Quiz App")
